It's quite simple. Just take off your armour (English spelling) until you're
wearing or wielding (but not both!) one item. Then read a scroll of Enchant
Armor or Enchant Weapon as appropriate while being confused. You will
find that your one wielded/worn item will glow a golden colour (English sp.)
and will henceforth be rustproof!

I once had a blessed +20 longsword named Excalibur (my favourite weapon) which
was also rustproof. This mega kicked ass.
